  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Domestic tasks",
   "texto": [
    "**Rydde** is to put things in order; **støvsuge** means to pass the vacuum cleaner. **Støvsuger** can be «pass the vacuum cleaner» or «aspiradora»: the subject and context clarify the meaning.",
    "**Vaske opp** means to wash the dishes; **oppvask** can be the task or the dishes to be washed. For «lavavajillas» it is said **oppvaskmaskin**."
   ]
  },
